  "body": "All day sun, expansive sea views and a sought after beachfront setting. This two bedroom penthouse at Mon Desir brings together so much of what makes Takapuna living special.\r\nPositioned on the top floor with a prized northerly aspect, the apartment enjoys views stretching out across the water and all the way up the channel. Watch the boats come and go, soak up the sunshine and enjoy an ever changing coastal outlook from the comfort of home.\r\n\r\nThe generous layout offers space to unwind and entertain, with light filled, open plan living making the most of the position. Two double bedrooms provide flexibility for guests and everyday living, whether you're seeking a permanent coastal home or an easy Auckland base. Two storage units add valuable space for those extras.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy access to a heated swimming pool and gym, making it easy to stay active or simply relax without leaving home.\r\nWith Takapuna Beach on your doorstep and cafés, restaurants and shops close by, you can leave the car behind and settle into a more relaxed daily routine. A morning beach walk, coffee with friends or dinner out. It's all part of the appeal.\r\n\r\nA sunny penthouse in this coveted Mon Desir position is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\nContact Team Rogers to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nTo view and download property files, please copy and paste the below link into your browser: \r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/KOWM",
